      · simp [P4.lm1, z, z'] at e
      · rw [lm1_jump z z'] at e; cases e; exact cl_TFTF_0_jump g0 g1 g2 g3 g4 h z z'
    · rw [lm1_slide z] at e; cases e; exact cl_TFTF_0_slide g0 g1 g2 g3 g4 h z
